    "en": "Kadane+",
    "to": "カダネ+"
  },
  {
    "en": "Kadane's algorithm scores each bolt as its power minus 3 and keeps a running best: the strongest run of neighbours fuses into one bolt, 2 stronger for every bolt in it.",
    "to": "カダネのアルゴリズムは各矢を「威力−3」で採点し、最善を更新しながら進みます。最も強い連続した矢の並びが1本に融合し、含まれる矢1本ごとに威力が2上がります。"
  },
  {
    "en": "Kadane",
    "to": "カダネ"
  },
  {
    "en": "Kadane's algorithm scores each bolt as its power minus 3 and keeps a running best: the stretch of neighbouring bolts with the highest score fuses into one bolt of its whole power, 1 stronger for every bolt in it.",
